# Byte-frozen evidence must survive `git checkout` byte-identical: the repo's
# hash guards (tests/evidence/*manifest*) sha256 raw file bytes. Without these
# rules, core.autocrlf on Windows silently rewrites LF -> CRLF on fresh clones
# and corrupts them (LightGBM's text model parser fatals on CRLF gbm.txt).
data/** -text
*.pkl binary
*.parquet binary
